stateDiagram-v2
    note left of booked
        booking.state values.
        Each transition is triggered by
        an app action or the timer.
    end note

    [*] --> booked : POST /book

    booked --> active : POST /open (driver arrives)
    booked --> cancelled : POST /cancel (before use)
    booked --> expired : timer (no-show, timed out)

    active --> done : POST /close

    done --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
